{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bbd6a8b1-be3c-8b46-b485-30c9468122d5",
  "created_at": "2025-12-10T13:01:03-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Bruce Thurston",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:59:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:59:25-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello, good afternoon. This is Bruce Thurston. I am calling about my property tax bill. I have the installment here, and, um, it is more than I planned for this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:59:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand, Mr. Thurston. What is the address on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:59:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "395 Bacheller Street. Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:59:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And how can I help you with the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:59:44-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I make a partial payment? Just pay some now, and the rest later? Or it must be the whole amount?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T12:59:51-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The city does accept partial payments toward a balance, but the unpaid portion will remain due by the original date, and interest can still apply to it. The bill itself will show you the due date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:00:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Okay. That is, um, not what I hoped, but I understand. [pause] Also, what are the hours for the assessor's office? I think my value is wrong, I want to ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:00:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The assessor's office is in City Hall and is open weekdays, during regular business hours, generally eight-thirty to four-thirty. I would suggest calling ahead to confirm before you come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:00:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eight-thirty to four-thirty. Good. One more thing. I work days, and I swim laps early in the morning at the community pool, so I am not free before work either. Can I pay on a Saturday? Is somebody there, or a way to pay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:00:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Hall is closed on Saturdays, sir. However, you can pay online through the city's website at any hour, and there is a payment drop box at City Hall that is available outside business hours. Checks go in the box, not cash."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:00:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, the drop box. Okay. So a check, not cash. I write that down. Online also, any hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:00:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct. Please make sure your payment is received by the due date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:00:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will. Thank you, Miss Whitcomb. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-10T13:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You as well, Mr. Thurston. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
